WEBVTT

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.260
Don't move, Raven Consort.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.860
Bingyue!

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.860
Correct. I'm impressed you knew it was me.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:12.480
You swine, get away from Jiu-jiu.

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:16.490
I'm the one who will be making 
 demands, Raven Consort.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.220
You mean the request you mentioned before?

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.430
Yes.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.040
Are you plotting the revival 
of the Luan family?

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:26.070
I'm not interested in that.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:29.750
There's simply someone 
I want you to help,

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:30.920
Raven Consort.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:40.260
Do you not understand that 
I'm telling you to get away from her?

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.920
I command you!

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.480
Master!

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.330
Stop!

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:03.580
You tore me from her by force.

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:08.080
If you're unable to cross over to paradise, 
allow me to send you there.

00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:22.770
Don't...

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:26.890
Don't do this!

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:35.070
Shouxue, that's enough.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:05.130
<i>I shall play the best role of all</i>

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:11.800
<i>The saddest role where one kills the most</i>

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:18.890
<i>Even at the ends of this square ocean, 
people change and are replaced</i>

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:24.880
<i>You forget that you're 
playing a role in this world</i>

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:28.250
<i>Everyone is just a bird in a cage</i>

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.930
<i>We all look forward to the day we can escape</i>

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:35.140
<i>And once it's within our grasp</i>

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:38.280
<i>The great big sky overwhelms us</i>

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:42.800
<i>MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:48.840
<i>Call out the name and bring calm</i>

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:58.840
<i>No one can stop your MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:07.270
<i>My MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:17.940
<i>Now, I shall play the best role of all</i>

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.970
Raven of the Inner Palace

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.640
She's merely unconscious.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.410
Lay her down over there.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:30.060
<b>Episode 7 
Glass Prayer</b>

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.640
You said there's someone 
you want me to help.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.740
Allow me to guess.

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.120
Is it Princess Mingzhu?

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.220
She's your aunt, isn't she?

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.200
She and my father had different mothers.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.630
She was even younger than me.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:49.120
I heard you were to be adopted 
by your master, Feng Yixing,

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.710
and have your name removed 
from the family register.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.870
That's strange.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:56.600
Why would you bother giving up 
the Luan family name?

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.960
The law against intermarriage.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.990
Previously, as long as 
they had different mothers,

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:06.080
brothers often married sisters, 
and uncles often married nieces.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:09.470
But starting with the Luan dynasty, 
it became forbidden.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.780
In other words, you tried 
to give up your family name

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:15.780
so you could marry someone 
within your family,

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:18.050
and that person was Princess Mingzhu.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:21.490
We were to be married shortly.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:24.690
The emperor said he would allow it

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:27.140
if I removed my name from
 the Luan family register.

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:29.490
Mingzhu was delighted,

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:31.980
but it all went up in smoke.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.500
I was captured by Xia's imperial guard,

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.800
beheaded by Yandi, and 
doomed to wander as a ghost.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.020
When I came to my senses, 
I was in the inner palace.

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:49.290
I searched for Mingzhu's body, 
as I'd heard she killed herself.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:54.110
I couldn't find it. However...

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.790
There was a ghost beneath the willow tree.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.270
Mingzhu's ghost.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.220
She was standing beneath the willow,

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:04.010
looking as she did in her final moments.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.300
Mingzhu. Mingzhu!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:10.360
Mingzhu, I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:15.540
Mingzhu, it's me. Can't you hear me?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.730
Mingzhu!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.290
My voice couldn't reach Mingzhu.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:25.640
Her mind was captivated by something, 
preventing her from hearing me.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:30.050
So I cannot send her to paradise.

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:35.530
Master Feng escaped the pursuers 
Yandi sent after him and went into hiding,

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.220
so I couldn't track him down.

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:41.640
I possessed several sorcerers and
 attempted to speak to Mingzhu,

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:42.900
but she never responded.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:47.320
Spring came and went countless times 
during my futile attempts.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:51.790
When I returned to the inner palace 
to see Mingzhu's ghost again,

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:54.150
I learned a new Raven Consort 
had been chosen.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:57.160
Not only that, but she was 
a member of the Luan family.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.500
I thought if things went well, 
I might be able to make a deal with her.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.090
I was a fool.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.430
If you hadn't used Jiu-jiu as a shield,

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.150
I would've calmly listened 
to what you had to say.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:15.220
Dawn is approaching.

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:18.100
Come with me.

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:27.380
Bingyue, you must know that 
Princess Mingzhu had a white glass comb.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:33.530
I gave it to her as a symbol 
of our engagement.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:37.360
I see. Do you know that it's been lost?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.500
Lost?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:44.000
We always met here when
 I visited the inner palace.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.350
I even proposed to her 
beneath this willow tree.

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:51.510
If she chose to die here because 
of the memories she shared with you,

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.360
it's hard to imagine she would have died

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:57.390
without her precious glass comb 
symbolizing your engagement.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:01.420
However, she wasn't 
wearing it when she died.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:06.830
She probably did not want the 
comb to be on her body

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:11.160
because she believed it would be
 plundered by Xia's men.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:15.590
Both her jade pendant and 
the blade she used to kill herself

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:18.180
are in the storehouse at Ningguang Hall.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:22.420
It was possible the comb would also have 
fallen into the hands of your killer, Yandi.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.210
She was probably determined to avoid that.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.590
Where is the comb, then?

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:34.680
With the soldiers approaching, I doubt 
she had time to hide it anywhere.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:38.610
She probably buried it.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.100
Qing.

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:50.570
They're the roots of the willow.

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:54.500
Use this.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:03.330
She was probably unable to leave this place 
because she was worried about this comb.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:08.170
Because she was so focused on that, 
not even your voice could reach her.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.960
How ironic.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.780
It's just a comb I gave her...

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:34.360
Mingzhu.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.380
I finally get to see you.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.200
Let's go together.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:08.020
Let's bury that comb at their grave.

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:10.180
That would be good.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.740
It's probably better that I don't touch it.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.680
You hold onto it.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:32.030
Your Highness.

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:34.750
Jiu-jiu, are you feeling better already?

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.800
Yes. As you can see, 
I'm completely fine now!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.790
I'm sorry for dragging you into this.

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.060
Don't say that.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.290
It's not your fault.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:46.920
Thank you for saving me.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:50.320
I still have something left to do.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.540
Go ahead and get some rest.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.460
In that case, I'll join you.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.770
You should rest.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.820
I need you to be well.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.880
If you insist.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:14.270
Xing-xing, don't worry.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:15.510
I'll be back soon.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:16.720
I'm not running away.

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:20.420
You're so aggravating, watchman of Niao Lian.

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:25.220
If you tell anyone, I'll roast you whole.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.120
I know this scent.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.000
Why are you here?

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.320
Wait. What are you doing?

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.630
Silence. Just watch.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:54.490
It'll be over soon.

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:55.480
Don't.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.340
They're harmless.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:01.860
You don't know what's 
harmless and what's not.

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:04.020
This is my area of expertise.

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:14.770
Wait!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:15.400
Don't!

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:38.150
The scent is gone.

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:40.140
What was that?

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:45.290
Why do you think they were 
standing in front of the door?

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:49.960
Probably because they had 
something to say to me.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:53.990
There's that, too, but they 
were guarding something.

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:56.060
Guarding what?

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.940
Fool. You, obviously.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:04.950
I heard they've been appearing
 over the past month.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.740
What happened roughly a month ago?

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:10.170
The empress dowager's execution.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:12.980
They must have begun appearing after that.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.310
What's the meaning of this?

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:19.300
I detected the scent of a beast 
near your bedchamber.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.470
It was the smell of a curse 
that was cast using a beast.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.970
A curse? Could it be?

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:27.470
The empress dowager left 
a curse in her final moments

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.960
so you'd be tormented even after her death.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.470
Then, my mother and Ding Lan...

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:37.260
They were preventing the curse 
from entering your bedchamber

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.980
just before it could reach you.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.050
Look up, Gaojun.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.550
Mother... Ding Lan...

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:04.300
Shouxue, why did you help me?

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:08.870
Aren't you angry with me?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.760
Don't you hate me?

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:17.270
I'm angry with the former
 summer and winter kings, not you.

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:22.610
If I'd allowed you to die, then those two—
who gave their lives to protect you—

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:24.400
wouldn't be able to rest in peace.

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.920
I see. Thank you.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:34.660
I don't want your gratitude.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.920
I owe you one. How shall I return the favor?

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:38.990
I don't need anything.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:42.250
Stay away from my palace. 
That's all I want from you.

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:47.180
What is it?

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:50.180
Is it truly impossible for me to help you?

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.180
I don't need your help.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:16.610
That man really is a fool.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.890
I'd like to make a suggestion.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.580
Is His Majesty busy?

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:31.440
He hasn't visited a single
 time since then.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:33.890
I've been quite at ease <i>because</i> he hasn't.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.020
There you go again.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:40.090
Something's been wrong with me 
ever since he started coming.

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.270
What?

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:44.240
I got carried away after 
hearing the emperor's request.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:46.530
I forgot my responsibilities 
as the Raven Consort.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:50.530
These days I have you, Hongqiao, 
and Wen Ying at my side.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:54.440
I'm even obligated to 
have tea with Huaniang.

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:59.290
You certainly can't keep postponing 
the Flower Princess's invitation.

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:02.660
I wonder what Li Niang would say 
if she could see me now.

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:06.300
She accepted the Raven Consort's fate

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.410
and sought nothing, formed no relationships,

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:12.880
and spent the rest of her days here
at Ye Ming Palace alone.

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:17.580
You don't want to see His Majesty?

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:21.040
I don't. Whenever he speaks my name,

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:24.220
I feel oddly unsettled. I can't relax.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.200
Which hairpin would you like to wear?

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.320
Well...

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.400
This will go well with the
 clothes Huaniang gave you.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:40.090
Oh, my.

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:43.330
Th-This was made to match 
these clothes, that's all!

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:46.090
I didn't say a thing.

00:15:53.190 --> 00:15:55.120
That looks lovely on you.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:05.720
Did you know His Majesty 
is revising the law?

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.610
He's been quite busy with that.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.980
I didn't. I'm not interested.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:16.620
He wrote in a letter to me that he will 
be unable to visit you for some time,

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.570
and asked me to pass on the message.

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:23.640
Why would he include a message 
for me in a letter to you?

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:28.320
He said you'd burn a letter 
from him without reading it.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:32.310
Would you like to have some of these?

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:34.050
I have plenty to spare.

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:41.080
My youngest sister is around 
the same age as you.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.030
Forgive me if I'm being rude,

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:45.510
but doing this makes me feel 
like I'm looking at my sister.

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:46.900
It makes me happy.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.190
I don't think that's rude.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:53.280
In that case, maybe I call you Amei?

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:57.740
You may call me Azi.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:08.000
How splendid that you and the
 Flower Princess call each other "sister."

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.000
I never said I'd call her that.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.510
Huaniang can be rather pushy.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.770
You seemed like real sisters to me.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.180
That's not...

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:20.860
I was wondering why the doors wouldn't open.

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:22.270
I see you were out.

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:25.270
I thought you wouldn't be 
able to visit for a while.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.200
So you heard from Huaniang.

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.610
I finished things sooner that I expected.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:32.960
This is...

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.290
What did you want to discuss?

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:44.590
I've been amending the laws.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.730
What does that have to do with me?

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.790
I've done away with some unnecessary laws,

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:53.220
like the death warrant on the Luan family.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:57.200
According to the register, all the members 
of the Luan family are deceased,

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:00.300
making that law no longer necessary.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.390
If the Raven Consort is what 
allows the emperor to exist,

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.810
then I cannot lose you.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:09.810
There is no law ordering your 
capture or death anymore.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.670
You need not fear any longer.

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:16.320
Have I offended you?

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:20.910
Look at these.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.330
This one is yours, and the other is mine.

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:27.260
Let us swear an oath.

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.500
An oath?

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:30.580
A promise between you and I.

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.840
The king of summer and the king of winter.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.430
What promise?

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:39.760
The first is the promise 
I made to you before.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:43.290
I will not kill you, no matter what.

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.920
There's more?

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:47.230
That you and I will not fight.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:49.600
I never intended to fight you.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:53.420
That would mean keeping you 
here as the Raven Consort

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.110
and not as the winter king.

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.660
There is no other path available to me,

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.500
nor do I seek anyone's help.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.760
When you and I are alone together,

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:09.570
I shall treat you as the winter king 
and not the Raven Consort.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.330
And not just you.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.840
I'd like to express my respect for all the
Raven Consorts who came before you as well.

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.620
Did you make these fish?

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:49.620
No. They are beyond even my ability.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.160
I had them made in a workshop.

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:55.940
Though I could make you a
 wooden carving in less time.

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.950
Nobody asked you to make a carving.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:00.580
I could make you birds, or even flowers.

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:02.980
Even roses?

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:06.200
I could make you roses, 
magnolias, or lotuses.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.810
I'd like a rose.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:10.890
Very well.

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:12.980
A wooden rose will not wilt.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:25.290
You're still not leaving? 
Haven't you concluded your business?

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:28.370
I forgot to mention the last of my promises.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.980
There's even more?

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.290
One more.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.710
I wish to become your friend.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:35.870
My friend?

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:39.590
Your friend. I wish to 
understand your suffering.

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:44.670
You're a fool.

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:45.750
Am I?

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.190
That's not an oath.

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:50.220
It's an oath I'm imposing on myself.

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:53.830
What do friends do, exactly?

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:56.230
It's not as though I know much 
about the subject,

00:20:57.100 --> 00:21:00.240
but I believe they drink tea together.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:02.950
Qing.

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:03.740
Yes?

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:06.200
Qing is excellent at making tea.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.240
Would you like to try some?

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.990
I wouldn't be opposed.

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:18.540
<i>Deep in the inner palace,</i>

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:22.430
<i>there lives a consort known 
as the Raven Consort.</i>

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:28.260
<i>She holds a special position. 
Despite her title of consort,</i>

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.340
<i>she does not perform nighttime duties.</i>

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.520
<i>Though she lives in the inner palace,</i>

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>she has no contact with the emperor.</i>

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:43.540
<i>But she has gained a friend.</i>

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:52.370
<i>My fate had tainted</i>

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:59.600
<i>The heavily falling snow black</i>

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:06.080
<i>The sun shines in gradually</i>

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:13.260
<i>And freshly melts it away 
with its summer warmth</i>

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:20.020
<i>The dream you saw in your eternal sleep</i>

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:25.170
<i>I'll do whatever I can to make it come true</i>

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:27.720
<i>(I want to help you, it's true)</i>

00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:33.710
<i>Because you made your wish to me</i>

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:40.780
<i>Just like the sun shining 
through the darkness</i>

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:46.350
<i>The bouquet of light</i>

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:54.800
<i>That you had given me</i>

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>Still connects the seasons 
that will never meet</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:07.830
<i>The proof of this pain</i>

00:23:07.830 --> 00:23:14.560
<i>Will it be able to stay the snow 
that falls in the summer?</i>

00:23:18.440 --> 00:23:21.370
I've thought of a name for you.

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:26.750
I borrowed a character from an
 apprentice I was going to adopt.

00:23:27.280 --> 00:23:29.010
Xiao Yue.

00:23:29.320 --> 00:23:32.900
It's a good name. Thank you, Master Feng.

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Blue Swallow</b>
